SUMMARY:Artist Round Up: Dioramas
LOCATION:Acadiana Center for the Arts\, 101 W Vermilion St\, Lafayette
DESCRIPTION:AcA's Artist Roundups gather together artists and creatives for
  a casual night of making connections while also making art. By bringing a
 rtists of various backgrounds together\, Artist Roundups hope to encourage
  dialogue and collaboration across artistic disciplines and create a share
 d sense of community and belonging. This month\, learn from AcA exhibiting
  artist Kate Gordon how to build small-scale collaged dioramas from painti
 ngs and found magazine clippings. The workshop will encourage artists to t
 hink spatially while using two-dimensional imagery. It will also offer the
  concept of using dioramas as a means to visualize exhibition plans and ev
 en curate spaces. Creatives of all levels and disciplines are encouraged t
 o attend. Materials will be provided.\n\nhttps://acadianacenterforthearts.
 org/events/artist-round-up-dioramas/?occurrence=2026-12-09
